[DEVELOPER] To fully POST seller onboarding data to `/register/seller` and collect all required fields, we need to: 1. **Match Backend Fields:** The backend expects at least: `business_name`, `contact_name`, `email`, and optionally `phone`, `address`, `website`, `business_type`, `tax_id`, `description`. 2. **Update Form State:** Add missing fields (`contact_name`, etc.) to the form state and UI. 3. **POST Data:** In `handleSubmit`, send a POST request to `/register/seller` with the mapped fields. 4. **Show Feedback:** Display success or error messages after submission. Below is the updated `frontend/pages/onboarding/seller.tsx` implementing these requirements: ```tsx import React, { useState } from 'react'; import Stepper from '../../components/Stepper'; import FormStep from '../../components/FormStep'; import InputField from '../../components/InputField'; const steps = ['Account Info', 'Business Details', 'Confirmation']; const SellerOnboarding = () => { const [currentStep, setCurrentStep] = useState(0); const [form, setForm] = useState({ email: '', password: '', contactName: '', phone: '', businessName: '', businessAddress: '', website: '', businessType: '', taxId: '', description: '', }); const [errors, setErrors] = useState<any>({}); const [submitStatus, setSubmitStatus] = useState<{success?: boolean, message?: string}>({}); const handleChange = (e: React.ChangeEvent<HTMLInputElement | HTMLTextAreaElement>) => { setForm({ ...form, [e.target.name]: e.target.value }); setErrors({ ...errors, [e.target.name]: '' }); }; const validateStep = () => { let stepErrors: any = {}; if (currentStep === 0) { if (!form.email) stepErrors.email = 'Email is required'; if (!form.password) stepErrors.password = 'Password is required'; if (!form.contactName) stepErrors.contactName = 'Contact name is required'; if (!form.phone) stepErrors.phone = 'Phone is required'; } if (currentStep === 1) { if (!form.businessName) stepErrors.businessName = 'Business name is required'; if (!form.businessAddress) stepErrors.businessAddress = 'Business address is required'; } setErrors(stepErrors); return Object.keys(stepErrors).length === 0; }; const handleNext = (e: React.FormEvent) => { e.preventDefault(); if (validateStep()) { setCurrentStep((prev) => prev + 1); } }; const handlePrev = () => { setCurrentStep((prev) => prev - 1); }; const handleSubmit = async (e: React.FormEvent) => { e.preventDefault(); setSubmitStatus({}); // Only send fields expected by backend const payload = { business_name: form.businessName, contact_name: form.contactName, email: form.email, phone: form.phone, address: form.businessAddress, website: form.website, business_type: form.businessType, tax_id: form.taxId, description: form.description, // password is intentionally omitted (backend does not expect it) }; try { const res = await fetch('/register/seller', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(payload), }); if (res.ok) { setSubmitStatus({ success: true, message: 'Seller onboarding complete!' }); } else { const data = await res.json(); setSubmitStatus({ success: false, message: data.detail || 'Submission failed.' }); } } catch (err) { setSubmitStatus({ success: false, message: 'Network error. Please try again.' }); } }; return ( <div style={{ maxWidth: 480, margin: '40px auto' }}> <Stepper steps={steps} currentStep={currentStep} /> <FormStep onSubmit={handleNext} isActive={currentStep === 0}> <InputField label="Email" name="email" type="email" value={form.email} onChange={handleChange} placeholder="Enter your email" error={errors.email} /> <InputField label="Password" name="password" type="password" value={form.password} onChange={handleChange} placeholder="Create a password" error={errors.password} /> <InputField label="Contact Name" name="contactName" value={form.contactName} onChange={handleChange} placeholder="Your full name" error={errors.contactName} /> <InputField label="Phone" name="phone" type="tel" value={form.phone} onChange={handleChange} placeholder="Phone number" error={errors.phone} /> <button type="submit">Next</button> </FormStep> <FormStep onSubmit={handleNext} isActive={currentStep === 1}> <InputField label="Business Name" name="businessName" value={form.businessName} onChange={handleChange} placeholder="Your business name" error={errors.businessName} /> <InputField label="Business Address" name="businessAddress" value={form.businessAddress} onChange={handleChange} placeholder="Business address" error={errors.businessAddress} /> <InputField label="Website" name="website" value={form.website} onChange={handleChange} placeholder="Business website (optional)" /> <InputField label="Business Type" name="businessType" value={form.businessType} onChange={handleChange} placeholder="e.g. Retail, Services (optional)" /> <InputField label="Tax ID" name="taxId" value={form.taxId} onChange={handleChange} placeholder="Tax ID (optional)" /> <InputField label="Description" name="description" value={form.description} onChange={handleChange} placeholder="Short business description (optional)" /> <div style={{ display: 'flex', gap: 8 }}> <button type="button" onClick={handlePrev}>Back</button> <button type="submit">Next</button> </div> </FormStep> <FormStep onSubmit={handleSubmit} isActive={currentStep === 2}> <h3>Confirm your details</h3> <ul> <li><b>Email:</b> {form.email}</li> <li><b>Contact Name:</b> {form.contactName}</li> <li><b>Phone:</b> {form.phone}</li> <li><b>Business Name:</b> {form.businessName}</li> <li><b>Business Address:</b> {form.businessAddress}</li> {form.website && <li><b>Website:</b> {form.website}</li>} {form.businessType && <li><b>Business Type:</b> {form.businessType}</li>} {form.taxId && <li><b>Tax ID:</b> {form.taxId}</li>} {form.description && <li><b>Description:</b> {form.description}</li>} </ul> {submitStatus.message && ( <div style={{ color: submitStatus.success ? 'green' : 'red', marginBottom: 8 }}> {submitStatus.message} </div> )} <div style={{ display: 'flex', gap: 8 }}> <button type="button" onClick={handlePrev}>Back</button> <button type="submit" disabled={submitStatus.success}>Finish</button> </div> </FormStep> </div> ); }; export default SellerOnboarding; ``` **Key changes:** - Added all required and optional fields to the form state and UI. - Added validation for required fields. - On submit, POSTs the correct payload to `/register/seller`. - Displays success or error feedback after submission. Now proceeding to update the file.
